  "brief": { "zh": "取到北站的信号旗，再从东南站台离开。巡逻车沿自己的轨道往返。与巡逻车同格或迎面交换位置都会被拦下。第 10 回合结束时中央检修口开放，第 20 回合结束时南侧围栏换道。第 43 回合结束前抵达站台。换班后的第二张地图调整了站台、旗位和巡逻车的发车方向。", "en": "Pick up the flag at the north station and reach the southeast platform. Patrol cars follow fixed tracks. Sharing a square or swapping squares head-on with a car ends the run. The central hatch opens after turn 10 and the south barrier changes after turn 20. Reach the platform by the end of turn 43. The second shift changes the platforms, flag position and starting direction of the patrol cars." },
